{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Delegate protocol for handling push notification events."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PWMessagingDelegate","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSObjectProtocol","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(pl)NSObject"}],"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Implement "},{"code":"PWMessagingDelegate","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to respond to push notification lifecycle events:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Received"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Notification arrived (app may be in foreground or background)"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Opened"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": User tapped on the notification","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Both methods provide a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PWMessage"},{"text":" object containing the notification payload, custom data, and metadata.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Implementation","level":2,"anchor":"Implementation","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Conform to the protocol"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Set the delegate on Pushwoosh"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Implement the methods you need"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["class AppDelegate: UIResponder, UIApplicationDelegate, PWMessagingDelegate {","","    func application(_ application: UIApplication,","                    didFinishLaunchingWithOptions launchOptions: [UIApplication.LaunchOptionsKey: Any]?) -> Bool {","","        Pushwoosh.configure.delegate = self","        Pushwoosh.configure.registerForPushNotifications()","","        return true","    }","","    func pushwoosh(_ pushwoosh: Pushwoosh, onMessageReceived message: PWMessage) {","        Analytics.log(\"push_received\", [","            \"title\": message.title ?? \"\",","            \"customData\": message.customData ?? [:]","        ])","    }","","    func pushwoosh(_ pushwoosh: Pushwoosh, onMessageOpened message: PWMessage) {","        handleDeepLink(from: message)","    }","","    private func handleDeepLink(from message: PWMessage) {","        guard let customData = message.customData,","              let screen = customData[\"screen\"] as? String else {","            return","        }","","        switch screen {","        case \"order\":","            if let orderId = customData[\"order_id\"] as? String {","                navigateToOrder(orderId)","            }","        case \"promo\":","            if let promoId = customData[\"promo_id\"] as? String {","                navigateToPromo(promoId)","            }","        default:","            break","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshframework\/pwmessagingdelegate"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]},{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshframework\/pwmessagingdelegate"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshiOS\/documentation\/PushwooshFramework"]]},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"protocol","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWMessagingDelegate","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Protocol","title":"PWMessagingDelegate","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PWMessagingDelegate"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PWMessagingDelegate","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Pu